#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Stable OpenAI-compatible broker for resident Pushbutton model instances.

Clients use one endpoint. The broker routes/reuses resident instances, respects
model/framework context ceilings, queues rather than oversubscribing proven
capacity, coordinates harmless idle calibration, and records normal-use
PP/TG/TTFT without storing prompt/output text.
"""
